        "id": 264318,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-10-29T17:22:31.114Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Voss used the majority of OAs power to create a barrier between “universe 1” (his own) and all others.  Before that, OblivAeon shattered the barriers that separate all universes.  I think, before that, Archaeon was the one who created those barriers in the first place.</p>\n<p>Adam is showering in all the money that a career in creating comic book card game roleplaying game books affords one.</p>\n<p>The Animalverse Grand Warlord is Reindeer Kel’Voss.</p>\n<p>A helpful mnemonic for players of the RPG: you can take a Bonus action to create a Boost, because Bonus Boost is an alliteration, and super famous heroes like Paul/ine Parsons or Maia Montgomery have alliterative names.  Villains less frequently have such alliterations, so taking the Hinder action to create a Penalty is a less heroic action.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2025-10-29T17:35:01.208Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
