        "raw": "Voss used the majority of OAs power to create a barrier between \"universe 1\" (his own) and all others.  Before that, OblivAeon shattered the barriers that separate all universes.  I think, before that, Archaeon was the one who created those barriers in the first place.\n\nAdam is showering in all the money that a career in creating comic book card game roleplaying game books affords one.\n\nThe Animalverse Grand Warlord is Reindeer Kel'Voss.\n\nA helpful mnemonic for players of the RPG: you can take a Bonus action to create a Boost, because Bonus Boost is an alliteration, and super famous heroes like Paul/ine Parsons or Maia Montgomery have alliterative names.  Villains less frequently have such alliterations, so taking the Hinder action to create a Penalty is a less heroic action.",
